le-2 targets chosen with the weighted count."},{"week":4,"label":"Week 4: Core skills repair","focus":["Quantitative evidence","Exponential and function notation","Inferences","Timed modules"],"hours":6.2,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":60,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium and hard questions in Information and Ideas → Command of evidence (quantitative) (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Log misses and guesses in the Notebook with a cause code and a rule sentence (https://practice.sat.schood.online/notebook)"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read Math: Advanced Math — exponential models and function notation (/math-advanced-math), 20 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium questions in Advanced Math → Nonlinear functions (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":60,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium questions in Information and Ideas → Inferences and Central ideas and details (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":60,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium questions in Advanced Math → Equivalent expressions (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Re-solve Notebook entries from the last 2–3 days without notes; close only correct re-solves"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":30,"tasks":["Read 20 minutes of dense nonfiction (science, history, economics) and summarise each article's claim in one sentence","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":70,"tasks":["Timed R&W module set: 27 mixed R&W questions in 32 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on","Timed Math module set: 22 mixed Math questions in 35 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on, Desmos allowed"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":30,"tasks":["Checkpoint: cause-code counts; are P and X codes falling?","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: cycle-2 target misses are lower in the timed sets than in mock 2. If P codes are not falling, add one extra timed module per section next week."},{"week":5,"label":"Week 5: Craft, structure and data","focus":["Third mock","Words in context","Text structure and cross-text","Percentages and statistics"],"hours":8,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":180,"tasks":["Full timed mock in the SAT simulator (https://sat.schood.online) at your real test time; one sitting with a 10-minute break"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":120,"tasks":["Forensic review of the mock: re-solve each missed, guessed and slow question before reading the explanation; assign cause codes C/P/T/X/G; name the trap; write a rule sentence","Log misses and guesses in the Notebook with a cause code and a rule sentence (https://practice.sat.schood.online/notebook)","Choose cycle-3 targets"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read R&W: Craft and Structure — words in context and text structure (/reading-writing-craft-structure), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium questions in Craft and Structure → Words in context and Text structure and purpose (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read Math: Problem-Solving and Data Analysis — percentages, ratios and one-variable data (/math-problem-solving-data-analysis), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium questions in Problem-Solving and Data Analysis → Percentages and One-variable data (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":30,"tasks":["Read 20 minutes of dense nonfiction (science, history, economics) and summarise each article's claim in one sentence","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":0,"tasks":["Rest day: no SAT work. Optional 20 minutes of reading nonfiction you enjoy"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":30,"tasks":["Re-solve Notebook entries from this week without notes; close only correct re-solves","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: mock 3 taken and reviewed; trend across three mocks recorded."},{"week":6,"label":"Week 6: Applications repair","focus":["Cross-text connections","Rhetorical synthesis and transitions","Geometry and trigonometry","Timed modules"],"hours":6.2,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":60,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium and hard questions in Craft and Structure → Cross-text connections (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Log misses and guesses in the Notebook with a cause code and a rule sentence (https://practice.sat.schood.online/notebook)"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read Math: Geometry and Trigonometry — right triangles, trigonometry and circles (/math-geometry-trigonometry), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 15 medium questions in Geometry and Trigonometry (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read R&W: Expression of Ideas — rhetorical synthesis and transitions (/reading-writing-expression-of-ideas), 20 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium and hard questions in Expression of Ideas (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":60,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium questions in Problem-Solving and Data Analysis → Two-variable data, probability and evaluating statistical claims (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Re-solve Notebook entries from the last 2–3 days without notes; close only correct re-solves"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":30,"tasks":["Read 20 minutes of dense nonfiction (science, history, economics) and summarise each article's claim in one sentence","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":70,"tasks":["Timed R&W module set: 27 mixed R&W questions in 32 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on","Timed Math module set: 22 mixed Math questions in 35 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on, Desmos allowed"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":30,"tasks":["Checkpoint: list the trap families that appear in two or more mocks","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: every domain in both sections has been drilled at least once, and you have a list of repeated trap families for cycle 4."},{"week":7,"label":"Week 7: Hard modules","focus":["Hard-only trap families","Desmos power moves","Fourth mock","Final-14-days start"],"hours":8.8,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":75,"tasks":["Read R&W Hard-Module Traps (premium) — your repeated trap families (/guide-rw-hard-module-traps), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 hard questions in your weakest R&W skill (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":75,"tasks":["Read Math Hard-Module Traps (premium) — your repeated trap families (/guide-math-hard-module-traps), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 15 hard questions in your weakest Math skill (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read Desmos Power Moves (premium) — sliders, systems and regressions (/guide-desmos-power-moves), 30 min","SAT Practice Bank: 10 hard questions in Math items where Desmos is faster (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":45,"tasks":["Read The Final 14 Days (premium) — review protocol and logistics (/guide-final-14-days), 20 min","Logistics check: device requirements, Bluebook updated, photo ID, calculator, route",