plan for that.","weekly_hours":{"min":8.6,"max":13.3,"total":47.4},"rules":["Every miss and every guess goes into the Notebook with a cause code and rule sentence on the same day.","Fix targets come from mock data, not from feelings: the two highest (misses × official domain weight).","No new topics in the last 48 hours before the test.","Sunday is rest unless a mock is scheduled."],"phases":[{"label":"Diagnose and high-yield fixes","weeks":[1],"goal":"Baseline mock, cause-coded review, and fast fixes in rule-based domains (conventions, linear algebra)."},{"label":"Targeted repair","weeks":[2],"goal":"Two-domain repair driven by the mock, plus a second full mock to confirm."},{"label":"Hard-module rehearsal","weeks":[3],"goal":"Hard-only drills on trap families and timed modules; begin the final-14-days schedule."},{"label":"Taper and test","weeks":[4],"goal":"Final full test, rule sheet, logistics, rest, test day."}],"modules":["sat-essentials","pacing-and-adaptive-modules","reading-writing-conventions","math-algebra","math-advanced-math","test-day-guide"],"guides":["guide-rw-hard-module-traps","guide-math-hard-module-traps","guide-desmos-power-moves","guide-final-14-days"],"weeks":[{"week":1,"label":"Week 1: Diagnose and high-yield fixes","focus":["Baseline full mock","Cause-coded review","Conventions rules","Linear algebra to automatic"],"hours":12.5,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":180,"tasks":["Full timed mock in the SAT simulator (https://sat.schood.online) at your real test time; one sitting with a 10-minute break","After the mock: 15-minute note on energy, timing and the hardest questions; no review yet"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":150,"tasks":["Forensic review of the mock: re-solve each missed, guessed and slow question before reading the explanation; assign cause codes C/P/T/X/G; name the trap; write a rule sentence","Log misses and guesses in the Notebook with a cause code and a rule sentence (https://practice.sat.schood.online/notebook)","Count misses by domain; multiply by official weight; pick the two fix targets for weeks 1–2"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":105,"tasks":["Read R&W: Standard English Conventions — boundaries (/reading-writing-conventions), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 25 medium questions in Standard English Conventions → Boundaries (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":105,"tasks":["Read Math: Algebra — systems and linear functions (/math-algebra), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 25 medium questions in Algebra → Systems of linear equations and Linear functions (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Read Desmos and Calculator Strategy — graphing both sides (/desmos-and-calculator-strategy), 15 min"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":105,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium questions in Standard English Conventions → Form, structure and sense (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","SAT Practice Bank: 15 medium questions in Algebra → Linear inequalities (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Re-solve Notebook entries from the last 2–3 days without notes; close only correct re-solves"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":105,"tasks":["Timed R&W module set: 27 mixed R&W questions in 32 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on","Timed Math module set: 22 mixed Math questions in 35 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on, Desmos allowed","Compare target-domain misses with the baseline mock"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":0,"tasks":["Rest day: no SAT work. Optional 20 minutes of reading nonfiction you enjoy"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: conventions and linear-algebra misses in the timed sets are clearly fewer than in the baseline mock. If not: repeat the week 1 drills on days 1–2 of week 2 before moving on."},{"week":2,"label":"Week 2: Targeted repair","focus":["Top two mock-driven domains","Evidence and data (R&W)","Quadratics and exponentials (Math)","Second full mock"],"hours":13.3,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":105,"tasks":["Read R&W: Information and Ideas — command of evidence (/reading-writing-information-ideas), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium and hard questions in Information and Ideas → Command of evidence (textual and quantitative) (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":105,"tasks":["Read Math: Advanced Math — quadratics and the discriminant (/math-advanced-math), 25 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium and hard questions in Advanced Math → Nonlinear equations and systems (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Log misses and guesses in the Notebook with a cause code and a rule sentence (https://practice.sat.schood.online/notebook)"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":105,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium and hard questions in Expression of Ideas → Rhetorical synthesis and Transitions (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","SAT Practice Bank: 15 medium questions in Advanced Math → Nonlinear functions (exponential models) (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":90,"tasks":["Read Desmos Power Moves (premium) — Moves 1–4 (/guide-desmos-power-moves), 30 min","SAT Practice Bank: 15 hard questions in Algebra and Advanced Math, solved with sliders or graphs where faster (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Re-solve Notebook entries from the last 2–3 days without notes; close only correct re-solves"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":60,"tasks":["Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 15 min","Light day before the mock: 10 easy questions per section; pack the mock as if it were test day"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":180,"tasks":["Full official Bluebook practice test (one you have not taken) at your real test time; one sitting with a 10-minute break"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":150,"tasks":["Forensic review of the mock: re-solve each missed, guessed and slow question before reading the explanation; assign cause codes C/P/T/X/G; name the trap; write a rule sentence","Log misses and guesses in the Notebook with a cause code and a rule sentence (https://practice.sat.schood.online/notebook)","Compare with mock 1: codes that repeat are the targets for week 3"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: mock 2 shows fewer misses in the week 1–2 target domains than mock 1, and fewer P/X codes. If a target domain did not improve, keep it as a target in week 3 and change the method (slower untimed sets, then timed)."},{"week":3,"label":"Week 3: Hard-module rehearsal","focus":["Trap families from the hard-module guides","Timed modules","Desmos speed","Start the final-14-days schedule"],"hours":13,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":105,"tasks":["Read R&W Hard-Module Traps (premium) — trap families matching your repeated codes (/guide-rw-hard-module-traps), 30 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 hard questions in your weakest R&W skill from mock 2 (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":105,"tasks":["Read Math Hard-Module Traps (premium) — trap families matching your repeated codes (/guide-math-hard-module-traps), 30 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 hard questions in your weakest Math skill from mock 2 (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":105,"tasks":["Timed R&W module set: 27 mixed R&W questions in 32 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on","Timed Math module set: 22 mixed Math questions in 35 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on, Desmos allowed","Count misses only in the two targets; log slow questions as well as wrong ones"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":90,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 15 hard questions in mixed R&W (interleaved skills) (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","SAT Practice Bank: 12 hard questions in mixed Math (interleaved skills) (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Re-solve Notebook entries from weeks 2–3 without notes; close only correct re-solves"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":75,"tasks":["Read The Final 14 Days (premium) — the forensic review protocol and logistics (/guide-final-14-days), 20 min","Logistics check: device requirements, Bluebook updated, photo ID, calculator batteries, route","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 15 min"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":180,"tasks":["Full timed mock in the SAT simulator (https://sat.schood.online) at your real test time; one sitting with a 10-minute break (final-14-days test 2)"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":120,"tasks":["Forensic review of the mock: re-solve each missed, guessed and slow question before reading the explanation; assign cause codes C/P/T/X/G; name the trap; write a rule sentence","Write the first draft of your ten-rule sheet"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: three mocks show a stable or rising trend, and no trap family appears in all three. If one does, give it the whole of day 1 in week 4."},{"week":4,"label":"Week 4: Taper and test","focus":["Final full test","Rule sheet","Exam setup and admission ticket","Rest and test day"],"hours":8.6,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":180,"tasks":["Full official Bluebook practice test (one you have not taken) at your real test time; one sitting with a 10-minute break (final full test, dress rehearsal)"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":120,"tasks":["Forensic review of the mock: re-solve each missed, guessed and slow question before reading the explanation; assign cause codes C/P/T/X/G; name the trap; write a rule sentence","Finalise the ten-rule sheet by hand"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":75,"tasks":["Exam setup in Bluebook and admission ticket (available 5 days before the test): complete setup, print the ticket, email it to yourself","Timed R&W module set: 27 mixed R&W questions in 32 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on","Read your rule sheet"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":75,"tasks":["Re-solve Notebook entries from the last 10 days without notes; close only correct re-solves","Timed Math module set: 22 mixed Math questions in 35 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on, Desmos allowed","Read your rule sheet"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":45,"tasks":["Rules and Desmos refresh: 15 conventions questions; rehearse your five most-used Desmos moves once each","Confirm route and arrival time from your admission ticket"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":20,"tasks":["Warm-up only: 6 easy R&W and 6 easy Math questions","Pack your bag with the checklist in The Final 14 Days (/guide-final-14-days); charge the device"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":0,"tasks":["Test eve or test day: follow the test-eve and test-day routines in The Final 14 Days. If your test is later in the week, shift days 1–6 so that day 6 is the eve"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: you arrive at the test with the device charged, exam setup completed, ticket and physical ID, and no new material studied in the last 48 hours."}],"checkpoints":[{"week":1,"title":"Baseline and targets","pass_rule":"Two fix targets chosen from weighted mock data; Notebook started.","if_not":"Do not start week 2 drills until targets are chosen."},{"week":2,"title":"Mock 2 comparison","pass_rule":"Target-domain misses and P/X codes lower than mock 1.","if_not":"Keep the same targets; switch to untimed method-first sets for two days."},{"week":3,"title":"Trend check","pass_rule":"Stable or rising mock trend; no trap family in all three mocks.","if_not":"Spend week 4 day 1 on the repeated family instead of a full test only if the test is more than 7 days away."},{"week":4,"title":"Ready to test","pass_rule":"Logistics complete; rule sheet written; rest routine followed.","if_not":"Logistics are not optional: finish exam setup and ticket before anything else."}]}$sat_pb$::jsonb, $sat_pb${"seeded_by":"20261026161100_sat_playbook_plan_templates","content_revision":"sat-pb-premium-2026-10-v1","source_file":"content/sat-playbook/plans/four-week-sprint.json","weekly_hours":{"min":8.6,"max":13.3,"total":47.4},"modules":["sat-essentials","pacing-and-adaptive-modules","reading-writing-conventions","math-algebra","math-advanced-math","test-day-guide"],"guides":["guide-rw-hard-module-traps","guide-math-hard-module-traps","guide-desmos-power-moves","guide-final-14-days"]}$sat_pb$::jsonb),
