.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read Math: Advanced Math — equivalent expressions (/math-advanced-math), 20 min","SAT Practice Bank: 15 medium and hard questions in Advanced Math → Equivalent expressions (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Read Desmos Power Moves (premium) — Move 7: overlay (/guide-desmos-power-moves), 10 min"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read Math Hard-Module Traps (premium) — trap families 5–7 (/guide-math-hard-module-traps), 20 min","SAT Practice Bank: 15 hard questions in Advanced Math and percentages (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":40,"tasks":["Timed Math module set: 22 mixed Math questions in 35 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on, Desmos allowed"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":45,"tasks":["Re-solve Notebook entries from weeks 3–4 without notes; close only correct re-solves","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 15 min"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":0,"tasks":["Rest day: no SAT work. Optional 20 minutes of reading nonfiction you enjoy"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: Advanced Math misses in the timed set are clearly fewer than in mock 2."},{"week":5,"label":"Week 5: Data analysis and geometry","focus":["Mock 3","Percentages and statistics","Geometry and trigonometry","Desmos lists and regressions"],"hours":7.8,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":180,"tasks":["Full timed mock in the SAT simulator (https://sat.schood.online) at your real test time; one sitting with a 10-minute break"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":90,"tasks":["Forensic review of the mock: re-solve each missed, guessed and slow question before reading the explanation; assign cause codes C/P/T/X/G; name the trap; write a rule sentence"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read Math: Problem-Solving and Data Analysis — percentages, data, probability 