entence"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read R&W: Craft and Structure — words in context (/reading-writing-craft-structure), 20 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 medium and hard questions in Craft and Structure → Words in context (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Write the punctuation or contrast clue for each blank"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":35,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 12 medium questions in Geometry and Trigonometry (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read R&W: Craft and Structure — text structure and cross-text (/reading-writing-craft-structure), 20 min","Read R&W Hard-Module Traps (premium) — trap families 3, 5 and 6 (/guide-rw-hard-module-traps), 15 min","SAT Practice Bank: 15 medium and hard questions in Craft and Structure → Text structure and purpose and Cross-text connections (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":50,"tasks":["Read 20 minutes of dense nonfiction (science, history, economics) and summarise each article's claim in one sentence","Re-solve Notebook entries from the last 2–3 days without notes; close only correct re-solves","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":0,"tasks":["Rest day: no SAT work. Optional 20 minutes of reading nonfiction you enjoy"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: every R&W skill drilled; mock 3 reviewed."},{"week":6,"label":"Week 6: Hard modules and pacing","focus":["Hard-only R&W","Pacing across skill groups","Timed R&W modules","Next step"],"hours":4.5,"days":[{"day":1,"weekday":"Mon","minutes":60,"tasks":["Read R&W Hard-Module Traps (premium) — trap families 7–11 and pacing (/guide-rw-hard-module-traps), 30 min","SAT Practice Bank: 15 hard questions in mixed R&W (interleaved skills) (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss"]},{"day":2,"weekday":"Tue","minutes":35,"tasks":["SAT Practice Bank: 12 medium and hard questions in mixed Math (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Clear due Reviews (https://practice.sat.schood.online/reviews), 10 min"]},{"day":3,"weekday":"Wed","minutes":50,"tasks":["Read Pacing and Adaptive Modules — R&W pacing (/pacing-and-adaptive-modules), 15 min","SAT Practice Bank: 20 hard questions in mixed R&W (https://practice.sat.schood.online/bank); review every miss","Track seconds per question: conventions under 45 seconds"]},{"day":4,"weekday":"Thu","minutes":40,"tasks":["Timed R&W module set: 27 mixed R&W questions in 32 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on"]},{"day":5,"weekday":"Fri","minutes":40,"tasks":["Timed R&W module set: 27 mixed R&W questions in 32 minutes from the SAT Practice Bank, timer on","Use a different question set from day 4"]},{"day":6,"weekday":"Sat","minutes":45,"tasks":["Re-solve Notebook entries from the whole plan without notes; close only correct re-solves","Decide the next plan: Eight-Week Standard (/plans/eight-week-standard) for continued balance, or the Four-Week Sprint (/plans/four-week-sprint) if a test is close"]},{"day":7,"weekday":"Sun","minutes":0,"tasks":["Rest day: no SAT work. Optional 20 minutes of reading nonfiction you enjoy"]}],"checkpoint":"Pass: two timed R&W modules finished on time with few misses."}],"checkpoints":[{"week":2,"title":"Rules secure","pass_rule":"Conventions and expression misses rare in a timed R&W set.","if_not":"Repeat week 2 before Information and Ideas."},{"week":4,"title":"Evidence secure","pass_rule":"Evidence misses fall from mock 2; TT errors rare.","if_not":"Extend week 4 by one week."},{"week":6,"title":"Section ready","pass_rule":"Two timed R&W modules on time with few misses.","if_not":"Repeat week 6 with new question sets."}]}$sat_pb$::jsonb, $sat_pb${"seeded_by":"20261026161100_sat_playbook_plan_templates","content_r